      "writtenOn": "2026-05-21T14:12:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I agree that they should be independent. I don\u0027t see a need to migrate the minStartForTaskQueue, as I think keeping them independent will work without much confusion. I think I was overthinking it (as I often do). But I do think we should consider adding this type of example to the docs to ensure that it is \"answered\" for anyone else questioning it.",
      "parentUuid": "9efb90d0_1326af6b",
      "revId": "42c392a91d78347ece1e0e9849b13d2c6df16001",
